<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>[ADMIN] New Report – Kaban</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f8f9fa; color: #7A7A7A; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: white; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .header { background: #6f42c1; color: white; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; }
    .content { padding: 40px 30px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #54595F; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>New Report – Action Required</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello Admin,</p>
      <p>A report has been submitted on listing: <strong>"{{listingTitle}}"</strong></p>
      <p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}</p>

      <p>Please review the listing and take appropriate action.</p>

      <p>Best regards,<br>Kaban System</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      Kaban Admin Panel
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>